──────────────────────────────
Each goal that is not a leaf is further decomposed into concrete tasks. The tasks (with numbering following depth‐first order) are as follows:

• For G2.1 (Direct Table Delivery):  
 – AT1: Place Food on Table  
  • Text: Place food directly onto the inpatient room table using special manipulation skills.  
  • Location: Inpatient Room  
  • Number of Robots: 1 (only one robot with the required skill is needed).  
  • Relation: Linked to G2.1 (AND).  
